ight=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage. Can no longer be <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">Poisoned</a></span>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arron\" title=\"Arron\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Arron.png/25px-Portrait_Arron.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Arron.png/38px-Portrait_Arron.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Arron.png/50px-Portrait_Arron.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arron\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Arron.png/25px-Portrait_Arron.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Portrait_Arron.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arron\" title=\"Arron\">Arron</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo\" title=\"Suspension of Muddy Goo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png/40px-Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Muddy_Goo\" title=\"Suspension of Muddy Goo\">Suspension of Muddy Goo</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mud_Mephit_Wing\" title=\"Mud Mephit Wing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png/20px-Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png/30px-Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png/40px-Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png/20px-Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Mud_Mephit_Wing_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mud_Mephit_Wing\" title=\"Mud Mephit Wing\">Mud Mephit Wing</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Sublimate</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Also grants immunity to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseous</a>.</li>\n<li>The name of the ingredient needed for alchemy creation differs from the extract created.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Elixir of Poison Resistance has 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit point</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/ima